# OpenAPI rules

`api/openapi.yaml` is the only HTTP contract source. Generate Go transport code
with ogen and the TypeScript Fetch client with Hey API. Commit generated files
and enforce zero drift. Handwritten code uses explicit domain mappers.

Snapshot is the only durable browser read model. Contract tests must enforce
the complete supported HTTP path set.
